WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.860
=Episode 26=

01:36.920 --> 01:37.759
Come on.

01:39.840 --> 01:40.680
Thank you.

01:41.509 --> 01:42.350
Thank you.

01:43.229 --> 01:44.070
Take your time.

01:44.160 --> 01:45.200
(This is)

01:45.200 --> 01:46.560
(tragic reality in this city.)

01:47.470 --> 01:48.310
(It seems we must)

01:48.310 --> 01:49.509
(think of an idea quickly)

01:49.920 --> 01:50.759
(to repel the Wutuo.)

01:50.759 --> 01:51.600
Is this enough?

01:53.120 --> 01:53.960
General Wu'an,

01:54.680 --> 01:55.560
the congee is shared.

01:56.479 --> 01:57.520
By the way, Ms. Qi Luo,

01:58.310 --> 01:59.280
didn't we send people

01:59.360 --> 02:01.280
to inform their families
to pick them up?

02:01.560 --> 02:03.630
Why hasn't anyone returned home?

02:03.870 --> 02:04.960
They were abducted

02:05.560 --> 02:06.430
and violated.

02:07.080 --> 02:09.190
Their families think they're a disgrace,

02:10.190 --> 02:11.430
refusing to take them back.

02:12.870 --> 02:14.710
This calamity wasn't their choice.

02:15.470 --> 02:17.000
They've narrowly escaped death,

02:17.400 --> 02:18.680
but their families bar the door.

02:19.470 --> 02:20.800
How ridiculous.

02:21.400 --> 02:22.680
If they were men,

02:23.430 --> 02:24.360
they'd already be home

02:24.680 --> 02:25.870
with their families.

02:26.280 --> 02:28.710
Maybe even praised as heroes.

02:29.520 --> 02:30.840
How could that be heroic?

02:31.190 --> 02:32.079
True heroes like you.

02:32.350 --> 02:33.560
Protecting homes and citizens.

02:34.030 --> 02:34.910
That's real heroism.

02:36.000 --> 02:36.840
And my master.

02:37.150 --> 02:38.190
You two

02:38.190 --> 02:40.470
are both great heroes
defending Wei's people.

02:43.030 --> 02:44.520
I won't claim to be a hero.

02:45.280 --> 02:46.120
As for Li Kuang,

02:47.420 --> 02:48.960
heroes don't follow the crowd

02:49.360 --> 02:52.360
or push suffering people
deeper into despair.

02:52.960 --> 02:54.400
Nor would they save rations

02:54.800 --> 02:57.430
by starving those they should protect.

02:58.000 --> 03:00.030
Are you blaming my master?

03:00.590 --> 03:02.310
He has his difficulties.

03:02.680 --> 03:04.150
The city's food reserves are low.

03:04.360 --> 03:05.680
He's deeply concerned.

03:05.870 --> 03:06.710
So...

03:08.080 --> 03:08.920
Ms. Qi Luo,

03:09.080 --> 03:09.920
are you alright?

03:10.430 --> 03:11.430
I have some ointment.

03:11.680 --> 03:12.520
I'll get it for you.

03:12.590 --> 03:14.800
These minor injuries are nothing.

03:15.240 --> 03:16.280
Don't blame my master.

03:16.750 --> 03:18.120
He's actually kind-hearted.

03:18.910 --> 03:20.680
He saved me from street thugs

03:21.190 --> 03:22.190
and gave me food

03:22.910 --> 03:24.680
and shelter.

03:25.120 --> 03:26.000
Ms. Qi Luo,

03:27.000 --> 03:28.120
is this what 'good' means?

03:28.800 --> 03:29.640
He married you.

03:29.750 --> 03:31.680
Shouldn't he care for you?

03:32.360 --> 03:33.590
In these chaotic times,

03:33.800 --> 03:34.840
as a woman,

03:35.360 --> 03:36.310
I belong to him.

03:36.590 --> 03:38.840
It's my duty to serve him well,

03:39.400 --> 03:41.079
respect him, obey him,

03:41.310 --> 03:42.590
and make him my universe.

03:42.800 --> 03:43.640
Slow down.

03:44.030 --> 03:44.870
Be careful.

03:46.400 --> 03:47.240
Is this better?

03:52.400 --> 03:53.240
Master.

03:54.030 --> 03:55.000
I'm scared.

03:55.680 --> 03:57.000
I don't want to go.

03:58.030 --> 03:59.710
I only want to stay with you.

03:59.800 --> 04:01.680
I don't want to be anyone's example.

04:04.080 --> 04:05.950
Rundu must not fall to Wutuo.

04:06.750 --> 04:08.270
As Rundu's defender,

04:09.270 --> 04:11.240
I'll protect it even
at the cost of my life.

04:12.510 --> 04:14.270
But with our current forces,

04:14.510 --> 04:15.750
we stand no chance.

04:16.070 --> 04:17.160
We must burn our boats

04:17.269 --> 04:18.110
and fight them

04:18.120 --> 04:19.040
to the bitter end!

04:20.000 --> 04:21.910
You and those female captives
are vanguards.

04:22.160 --> 04:24.070
After you distract the Wutuo forces,

04:24.950 --> 04:26.160
I'll lead the army to battle

04:26.830 --> 04:28.160
and die defending Rundu.

04:39.159 --> 04:40.240
I understand now.

04:46.270 --> 04:47.430
I'll go.

04:50.120 --> 04:51.480
Please take care.

04:54.680 --> 04:56.070
He, He.

04:58.080 --> 04:59.750
Mai and I heard something

04:59.750 --> 05:00.590
on our way here.

05:00.910 --> 05:01.750
Li Kuang

05:01.750 --> 05:03.170
plans to send the women we rescued

05:03.170 --> 05:04.720
to the battlefield

05:04.720 --> 05:05.800
to fight the enemies!

05:07.830 --> 05:09.430
He's sending them to die!

05:13.870 --> 05:14.710
Let's go.

05:34.040 --> 05:35.070
Tainted by the enemy.

05:35.950 --> 05:37.070
Disgrace to the family.

05:38.750 --> 05:39.750
Not worthy to live.

05:41.390 --> 05:42.310
Not worthy to live.

05:51.950 --> 05:52.790
Mr. Wang,

05:53.240 --> 05:54.390
as the Military Director,

05:54.830 --> 05:56.070
I can command you.

05:56.950 --> 05:57.790
By my order,

05:58.159 --> 05:59.000
do not open the gate.

06:00.720 --> 06:01.560
Mr. Chu.

06:01.920 --> 06:03.360
All hangs on this move.

06:03.800 --> 06:06.040
But I serve Rundu's garrison.

06:06.680 --> 06:08.310
We only obey Commander Li's orders.

06:09.870 --> 06:10.710
Open the gate.

06:12.920 --> 06:13.760
Mr. Wang!

06:18.190 --> 06:19.270
Open the gate!

06:57.510 --> 06:58.720
Let me see who will open it!

06:59.240 --> 07:00.680
This is Rundu.

07:01.000 --> 07:02.950
I'm General Wu'an
appointed by His Majesty.

07:03.560 --> 07:04.830
Not under your jurisdiction.

07:06.590 --> 07:08.270
I'm not your soldier.

07:18.430 --> 07:19.270
Lure the enemy?

07:19.950 --> 07:20.790
Commander Li.

07:20.950 --> 07:22.310
You're just sacrificing lives.

07:23.120 --> 07:23.960
General Wu'an.

07:24.270 --> 07:25.560
Your contributions to Rundu

07:25.870 --> 07:27.160
are deeply appreciated.

07:27.680 --> 07:28.560
But even so,

07:28.720 --> 07:30.520
you can't interfere in
our military affairs.

07:31.360 --> 07:33.240
If you overstep again,

07:33.680 --> 07:34.520
just leave Rundu.

07:34.670 --> 07:36.350
You're the one who should leave!

07:38.920 --> 07:39.800
Please calm down.

07:42.430 --> 07:43.600
Don't blame Commander Li.

07:44.310 --> 07:45.150
We

07:45.600 --> 07:46.510
volunteered.

07:47.720 --> 07:48.560
We are

07:48.750 --> 07:50.190
defiled.

07:51.000 --> 07:52.560
No dignity to keep living.

07:54.159 --> 07:55.360
If our deaths

07:55.950 --> 07:57.430
can gain Rundu an advantage,

07:57.720 --> 07:59.750
we'll cleanse our shame

08:00.240 --> 08:01.510
and die with honor.

08:02.120 --> 08:03.870
Commander Li
entrusted us with this task.

08:04.270 --> 08:05.430
He's giving us chances.

08:06.800 --> 08:07.640
If we can

08:08.190 --> 08:09.390
deceive the Wutuo enemies

08:09.840 --> 08:10.680
and make them believe

08:10.680 --> 08:11.920
Rundu has no fighters left,

08:12.390 --> 08:14.040
we'll gain an advantage

08:14.430 --> 08:15.270
and strike them

08:15.270 --> 08:16.390
unprepared at the showdown.

08:16.830 --> 08:17.670
Chances?

08:18.240 --> 08:19.720
So I'm blocking your way to merit?

08:23.550 --> 08:24.390
Yes.

08:25.120 --> 08:26.030
In crisis,

08:26.840 --> 08:28.360
we should unite

08:28.550 --> 08:29.480
against foes.

08:29.670 --> 08:31.960
But not by sending you
to die pointlessly.

08:32.440 --> 08:33.600
This isn't courage.

08:34.030 --> 08:34.909
This is foolishness.

08:35.360 --> 08:36.270
Watch your words!

08:38.080 --> 08:38.919
Li Kuang,

08:39.390 --> 08:40.750
as Rundu's commander,

08:41.510 --> 08:44.360
you point blades
at your women and people.

08:45.000 --> 08:45.840
What's this?

08:46.550 --> 08:47.550
They volunteered.

08:48.440 --> 08:49.480
Their sortie

08:49.510 --> 08:51.280
is to deceive the enemy and buy time.

08:51.910 --> 08:54.360
As the Rundu commander,
I'll lead the charge

08:55.000 --> 08:56.750
and fight to the death
defending this city.

08:57.390 --> 08:58.790
Better die meaningfully

08:59.200 --> 09:00.270
than live in shame.

09:02.000 --> 09:02.840
Volunteered?

09:05.030 --> 09:05.870
Let me ask you.

09:07.000 --> 09:08.510
Are you truly willing?

09:13.320 --> 09:14.790
I... I...

09:15.480 --> 09:16.750
I don't want to die.

09:17.760 --> 09:19.870
I want to live with dignity.

09:23.750 --> 09:25.120
You shouldn't feel ashamed.

09:25.790 --> 09:26.840
Shame belongs to

09:27.320 --> 09:28.550
Commander Li.

09:33.080 --> 09:33.920
Li Kuang.

09:34.120 --> 09:35.200
Did they volunteer

09:35.630 --> 09:37.600
or were they forced to do this?

09:38.240 --> 09:39.550
You know the truth.

09:40.000 --> 09:42.360
Aren't they Rundu's citizens?

09:43.720 --> 09:44.960
As the city's commander,

09:45.480 --> 09:46.320
you make

09:46.320 --> 09:48.550
those you should protect die needlessly.

09:51.030 --> 09:51.870
Swords

09:52.720 --> 09:54.080
are for enemies.

09:54.910 --> 09:56.670
Never against the weak.

09:59.240 --> 10:00.080
Yes.

10:03.030 --> 10:04.270
Never against the weak.

10:13.720 --> 10:14.560
Commander.

10:22.910 --> 10:24.240
You haven't changed.

10:25.320 --> 10:26.240
General Zhang

10:26.870 --> 10:28.840
used a few citizens as bait.

10:29.870 --> 10:31.200
It lacked compassion.

10:31.870 --> 10:33.630
But compared to losing the city,

10:34.120 --> 10:37.510
it was minor.

10:37.960 --> 10:41.120
So, in a crisis, we must
make such a trade-off.

10:43.360 --> 10:44.200
Sir,

10:44.600 --> 10:46.000
but I hold a different view.

10:46.840 --> 10:48.320
I understand General Zhang.

10:48.720 --> 10:49.840
But if it were me,

10:50.510 --> 10:51.630
I would never act this way.

10:52.200 --> 10:53.750
I'd lead the remaining soldiers

10:54.120 --> 10:54.960
to fight the rebels

10:55.360 --> 10:56.840
at the city gates.

10:57.840 --> 10:59.150
The one who wields the sword

10:59.550 --> 11:00.390
must know

11:00.790 --> 11:02.790
whether the blade is meant

11:03.790 --> 11:05.240
for the enemy in front

11:05.750 --> 11:07.360
or the weak behind them.

11:10.270 --> 11:12.120
I will never draw
my sword against the weak.

11:26.000 --> 11:28.480
C-C-Commander Xiao's here? How?

11:29.600 --> 11:30.870
Do you think

11:31.310 --> 11:32.150
it's because of...?

11:32.150 --> 11:33.910
Because of our absence from camp,

11:34.390 --> 11:35.230
he came to punish us?

11:36.630 --> 11:38.720
No, that can't be it.

11:39.240 --> 11:40.390
He seems in good spirits.

11:41.120 --> 11:42.000
He even smiled.

11:43.150 --> 11:43.990
Really?

11:44.200 --> 11:45.150
Absolutely true.

11:45.790 --> 11:49.320
D-D-Don't worry.

11:49.320 --> 11:50.910
S-S-Stop mocking me.

11:52.390 --> 11:53.230
General Fengyun,

11:53.720 --> 11:54.560
how did you get in?

11:55.150 --> 11:56.080
I fought my way through

11:56.630 --> 11:57.600
with my battalion.

11:59.080 --> 12:00.630
Commander Xiao, it must be hard work.

12:03.720 --> 12:04.560
Commander Li,

12:05.630 --> 12:07.270
General Wu'an is my man.

12:08.030 --> 12:09.600
My soldiers' discipline

12:10.270 --> 12:11.360
is my own responsibility.

12:11.870 --> 12:13.270
No outsiders may interfere.

12:14.270 --> 12:15.120
Besides,

12:16.320 --> 12:17.160
he wasn't wrong.

12:21.200 --> 12:23.600
I know I'm the one at fault.

12:23.630 --> 12:25.440
But I'm ready to die defending Rundu.

12:25.480 --> 12:26.550
Already thinking of defeat?

12:26.910 --> 12:29.000
Rundu needs
no cowardly commanders like you.

12:36.240 --> 12:37.390
Warriors fear not death

12:38.390 --> 12:39.910
but wield swords to protect our land

12:40.750 --> 12:41.840
and our people.

12:50.390 --> 12:51.230
Soldiers!

12:51.550 --> 12:52.440
Both we and the Wutuo

12:52.840 --> 12:53.720
lack supplies.

12:54.270 --> 12:55.630
This is a do-or-die battle.

12:56.120 --> 12:58.390
The brave will win.

12:59.030 --> 12:59.870
Besides,

13:00.870 --> 13:03.440
General Fengyun's reinforcements
have arrived.

13:04.720 --> 13:06.270
Director Chu of the Ministry of War

13:06.910 --> 13:08.120
has brought us provisions.

13:09.270 --> 13:12.320
Millions of Wei citizens
stand behind us.

13:13.120 --> 13:14.150
As warriors,

13:14.790 --> 13:16.480
we raise swords to protect our land

13:16.720 --> 13:17.630
and our people!

13:18.670 --> 13:19.510
Soldiers!

13:19.840 --> 13:21.000
Will you join me

13:21.630 --> 13:23.960
to fight the enemy outside, repel Wutuo,

13:24.550 --> 13:25.550
and defend Rundu

13:26.200 --> 13:27.360
and Wei?

13:27.790 --> 13:28.670
- Yes!
- Yes!

13:29.510 --> 13:30.350
General Fengyun

13:30.960 --> 13:32.670
and General Wu'an stand with Rundu.

13:33.320 --> 13:34.160
This battle,

13:34.630 --> 13:35.670
we will win!

13:36.440 --> 13:40.580
- Win!
- Win!

13:40.580 --> 13:44.720
- Win!
- Win!

14:13.910 --> 14:14.750
The wind's here.

14:18.240 --> 14:19.080
Smoke out!

14:22.300 --> 14:23.620
(Rundu City)

14:45.400 --> 14:46.240
What?

14:46.240 --> 14:47.120
What's all this smoke?

14:47.200 --> 14:48.040
Yeah.

14:48.270 --> 14:49.110
Such dense smoke.

14:58.870 --> 14:59.960
Commander, please...

15:00.840 --> 15:01.680
Hear that?

15:11.910 --> 15:12.750
Arrows approaching.

15:28.270 --> 15:29.440
A mere smokescreen.

15:29.960 --> 15:30.800
Nothing to fear.

15:31.200 --> 15:32.040
Archers, ready.

16:16.000 --> 16:16.840
Charge!

17:42.030 --> 17:43.110
Capture their leader first.

17:58.240 --> 17:59.440
(They fight with no retreat.)

17:59.960 --> 18:01.440
(So I'm their true target.)

18:02.830 --> 18:03.920
All troops, heed orders!

18:04.680 --> 18:05.640
Defend the headquarters!

18:06.550 --> 18:07.640
Let their blood

18:07.920 --> 18:09.110
consecrate our banners!

18:10.960 --> 18:12.160
Defend the headquarters!

18:13.440 --> 18:14.280
Charge!

18:14.640 --> 18:15.920
- Charge!
- Charge!

18:54.830 --> 18:55.880
Sacrificing your own man.

18:56.030 --> 18:57.000
How heartless.

18:57.480 --> 18:58.320
Dying for me

18:58.550 --> 18:59.480
is their noblest end.

19:46.790 --> 19:48.030
Comrades who stand together

19:48.640 --> 19:49.920
make true commanders.

20:00.070 --> 20:00.910
Xiao Jue!

20:15.590 --> 20:16.440
Xiao Jue!

20:21.110 --> 20:23.590
Xiao Jue!

20:32.070 --> 20:32.910
Xiao Jue.

20:33.920 --> 20:34.760
Xiao Jue.

21:05.030 --> 21:06.270
Xiao Jue.

21:23.750 --> 21:26.110
Xiao Jue!

21:46.350 --> 21:47.960
Xiao Jue.

22:57.170 --> 22:59.330
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

22:59.430 --> 23:03.350
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

23:03.350 --> 23:05.470
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

23:05.470 --> 23:10.530
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

23:14.160 --> 23:15.110
I thought

23:16.030 --> 23:17.590
I'd never see you again.

23:19.350 --> 23:20.190
You're still here.

23:20.190 --> 23:22.370
♪There must always be a longing♪

23:22.720 --> 23:23.680
I can't die.

23:23.680 --> 23:28.290
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

23:28.530 --> 23:30.690
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

23:30.790 --> 23:34.620
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

23:34.720 --> 23:40.630
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

23:41.360 --> 23:45.440
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

23:47.600 --> 23:49.630
♪With our unwavering true love♪

23:49.630 --> 23:55.820
♪With you by my side♪

24:04.440 --> 24:05.440
We're short-handed.

24:05.640 --> 24:06.480
Go to ask Yan He

24:06.480 --> 24:07.320
for reinforcements.

24:08.030 --> 24:08.870
The journey's long.

24:09.000 --> 24:09.840
Ride at full speed.

24:10.200 --> 24:11.040
Depart immediately.

24:11.110 --> 24:11.950
Yes.

24:12.630 --> 24:13.980
(Yan)

24:15.680 --> 24:16.520
Xiao Huaijin.

24:34.160 --> 24:35.240
The supplies have arrived.

24:35.750 --> 24:36.830
Yingxiang and Ms. Qi Luo

24:37.110 --> 24:39.070
are making congee
with the rescued women.

24:39.070 --> 24:40.920
Thanks to your foresight, Mr. Chu.

24:41.270 --> 24:42.680
Before coming, you had Yingxiang

24:42.720 --> 24:43.590
gather provisions.

24:44.750 --> 24:46.480
I don't deserve such praise.

24:47.000 --> 24:48.200
My part was small.

24:48.680 --> 24:49.640
We brought in the grain

24:49.830 --> 24:50.830
after the battle ended.

24:51.680 --> 24:52.750
Thank you, Commander Xiao.

24:53.400 --> 24:54.350
You led reinforcements

24:54.680 --> 24:55.880
and summoned General Yan He.

24:56.920 --> 24:57.790
It's my duty.

24:58.240 --> 24:59.510
No thanks needed, Mr. Chu.

24:59.830 --> 25:00.670
Everyone.

25:02.790 --> 25:03.880
Rundu survived this crisis

25:04.110 --> 25:05.350
through your assistance.

25:06.160 --> 25:07.880
On behalf of all in Rundu,

25:08.200 --> 25:09.040
let me say thank you.

25:12.310 --> 25:13.200
Don't mention it.

25:13.920 --> 25:14.760
Protecting civilians

25:15.000 --> 25:15.960
is our duty.

25:16.400 --> 25:17.270
Aiding each other

25:17.640 --> 25:18.480
is our obligation.

25:19.200 --> 25:20.040
No thanks required.

25:21.030 --> 25:21.870
Yeah.

25:22.000 --> 25:22.840
Duty.

25:23.400 --> 25:24.240
Obligation.

25:24.680 --> 25:25.750
But some people...

25:36.160 --> 25:37.000
General Wu'an,

25:37.320 --> 25:38.160
you remind me

25:38.160 --> 25:39.160
of my friend.

25:43.030 --> 25:44.960
No, the person he used to be.

25:57.440 --> 25:58.280
Don't tell me

25:58.640 --> 26:00.880
he thinks you resemble He Rufei.

26:02.720 --> 26:03.790
What's wrong with him?

26:04.200 --> 26:05.790
You're much better than He Rufei.

26:06.680 --> 26:07.520
How about

26:07.790 --> 26:08.640
you leave Xiao Jue

26:09.200 --> 26:10.350
and join my command?

26:18.640 --> 26:19.480
Yan He.

26:19.880 --> 26:20.720
So eager

26:21.070 --> 26:22.310
to poach him?

26:23.030 --> 26:24.830
Shouldn't you ask me first?

26:25.640 --> 26:26.480
Cold Xiao,

26:26.790 --> 26:27.750
why so stingy?

26:29.070 --> 26:29.910
Commander Xiao.

26:30.640 --> 26:31.480
Mr. He

26:31.720 --> 26:32.920
is now General Wu'an.

26:33.480 --> 26:34.350
Where he wants to go

26:35.880 --> 26:36.720
isn't your decision.

26:41.310 --> 26:43.030
Of course it's not my decision.

26:47.640 --> 26:48.480
Where he goes,

26:49.350 --> 26:50.190
what he does,

26:51.310 --> 26:52.400
it's all his choice.

27:25.440 --> 27:26.280
Commander.

27:28.510 --> 27:29.350
Commander,

27:29.510 --> 27:30.480
I was going to see you.

27:31.240 --> 27:32.270
Leaving Yezhou Garrison

27:32.400 --> 27:33.550
was my decision alone.

27:34.070 --> 27:35.200
Wang Ba and Huang Xiong

27:35.590 --> 27:36.640
were forced by me.

27:37.270 --> 27:38.510
Please don't punish them.

27:39.110 --> 27:39.960
All blame

27:40.480 --> 27:41.720
should fall on me alone.

27:43.400 --> 27:44.240
Is that all?

27:44.830 --> 27:45.670
Yes.

27:49.110 --> 27:49.950
Follow me.

28:24.720 --> 28:25.560
Commander.

28:26.350 --> 28:27.190
What's this about?

28:28.960 --> 28:30.070
Before resolving the matter,

28:31.270 --> 28:32.400
you left a letter

28:33.200 --> 28:35.160
and a pouch and then disappeared.

28:36.160 --> 28:37.000
What's that about?

28:41.960 --> 28:42.800
What?

28:43.200 --> 28:44.270
You left something else?

28:46.030 --> 28:46.870
Nothing else.

28:48.550 --> 28:49.590
I left the letter

28:50.200 --> 28:51.040
because

28:51.400 --> 28:52.790
I've earned the general title,

28:53.440 --> 28:54.550
but I'm still your soldier.

28:55.200 --> 28:56.110
I left without orders,

28:56.440 --> 28:57.510
and I must tell you why.

28:58.070 --> 28:59.400
As for this pouch,

29:01.590 --> 29:02.680
I took the Qinglang Sword

29:03.240 --> 29:04.270
without permission.

29:04.880 --> 29:06.870
This pouch serves as my apology.

29:21.200 --> 29:22.040
He Yan,

29:22.590 --> 29:24.110
my judgment was clouded,

29:24.920 --> 29:26.310
and I couldn't move past it,

29:27.000 --> 29:27.840
so I mistakenly

29:28.160 --> 29:30.790
equated you with that scheming wretch,

29:31.440 --> 29:32.350
He Rufei.

29:34.240 --> 29:35.160
I should've known it.

29:35.590 --> 29:37.870
You are just you.

29:38.550 --> 29:39.440
You've always been

29:40.200 --> 29:41.550
my tenacious classmate

29:42.590 --> 29:44.070
with unwavering integrity,

29:46.550 --> 29:48.030
the general who defended our borders

29:49.640 --> 29:51.350
without hesitation
even in mortal danger.

29:54.440 --> 29:55.590
After returning from Peidu,

29:56.510 --> 29:57.590
I wanted to apologize

29:58.790 --> 30:00.310
and clarify everything

30:02.070 --> 30:03.030
and then accompany you

30:03.960 --> 30:05.000
to reinforce Rundu.

30:06.400 --> 30:07.240
But by then,

30:08.110 --> 30:09.510
you had left Yezhou Garrison.

30:11.510 --> 30:12.350
I thought

30:14.160 --> 30:15.400
you must have gone to Rundu.

30:18.240 --> 30:19.270
While in Chonghuai,

30:20.430 --> 30:22.350
I considered confessing
everything to you.

30:23.350 --> 30:25.000
But while I was still hesitating,

30:25.510 --> 30:26.750
you uncovered it yourself.

30:28.510 --> 30:29.350
He Yan,

30:30.430 --> 30:32.640
no matter what storms lie ahead,

30:35.240 --> 30:36.310
I will always trust you

30:38.720 --> 30:39.680
and stand with you

30:41.400 --> 30:42.480
to overcome hardship.

30:46.550 --> 30:47.390
Good.

30:49.550 --> 30:50.390
Long time no see,

30:51.510 --> 30:52.350
Commander Xiao.

30:57.680 --> 30:58.520
It's been a while,

31:00.440 --> 31:01.280
General He.

31:15.030 --> 31:16.400
Miss... Miss He,

31:16.920 --> 31:18.310
my temper was terrible,

31:18.680 --> 31:19.750
and I was hostile to you.

31:20.120 --> 31:22.350
The Commander had me
look into He Rufei in the capital.

31:22.910 --> 31:24.640
Then I realized I'd wronged you.

31:25.880 --> 31:26.720
Please forgive me.

31:27.750 --> 31:28.590
It's understandable.

31:29.270 --> 31:30.110
I bear no grudge.

31:30.830 --> 31:31.670
Besides,

31:32.350 --> 31:33.200
didn't the Commander

31:33.510 --> 31:35.640
give me the cold shoulder for days?

31:39.400 --> 31:41.590
You're magnanimous, Miss He.

31:43.200 --> 31:44.040
Please forgive me.

31:47.070 --> 31:48.400
I'm generous,

31:49.000 --> 31:50.240
so you're forgiven.

31:56.350 --> 31:57.510
But as for some matters,

31:58.920 --> 32:00.480
I can never overlook them.

32:02.310 --> 32:05.000
I must personally expose
He Rufei's hypocrisy

32:05.700 --> 32:07.070
and ensure both he and Xu Jingfu

32:07.480 --> 32:08.790
face proper justice.

32:09.440 --> 32:10.550
Following your orders,

32:11.070 --> 32:12.950
I investigated the Huayuan Battle.

32:12.950 --> 32:15.160
The seven generals
initially divided into

32:15.440 --> 32:16.480
three groups as planned

32:16.960 --> 32:19.070
to support He Rufei who was
against Wutuo's main army.

32:19.710 --> 32:20.550
But en route,

32:20.550 --> 32:21.920
they all fell into Wutuo ambushes.

32:22.400 --> 32:23.400
All seven perished.

32:23.830 --> 32:25.200
Then He Rufei avenged them

32:25.680 --> 32:27.000
by crushing the Wutuo forces

32:27.350 --> 32:28.590
and driving them from Huayuan.

32:28.590 --> 32:29.790
This reeks of deception.

32:31.110 --> 32:32.790
Three separate groups

32:33.070 --> 32:34.720
were all ambushed?

32:34.960 --> 32:36.070
No survivors?

32:36.750 --> 32:38.790
He Rufei alone

32:39.110 --> 32:40.160
emerged victorious,

32:40.590 --> 32:41.430
repelling

32:41.440 --> 32:42.830
the formidable Wutuo army?

32:44.400 --> 32:45.400
He Rufei

32:45.750 --> 32:48.240
schemed to conceal his true identity.

32:48.750 --> 32:49.960
He teamed up with Wutuo again

32:50.350 --> 32:51.270
and set the ambush

32:51.790 --> 32:52.830
to kill them indirectly.

32:53.350 --> 32:54.960
Suspecting your survival,

32:55.830 --> 32:57.510
he first used the Wutuo forces to kill

32:58.160 --> 32:59.400
the Seven Tiger Generals.

33:00.000 --> 33:01.510
Then he dangled Li Kuang of Rundu

33:01.960 --> 33:02.800
as bait for you.

33:03.480 --> 33:04.720
If you rescued Li Kuang,

33:05.440 --> 33:06.680
you'd walk into his trap.

33:07.350 --> 33:08.720
He'd repeat his old tactics,

33:08.720 --> 33:11.200
using Wutuo to eliminate you.

33:12.440 --> 33:13.440
Before coming to Rundu,

33:14.040 --> 33:16.400
I knew this was his scheme.

33:17.360 --> 33:19.820
But whether for my past comrade

33:19.820 --> 33:21.680
or the people of Rundu,

33:22.240 --> 33:23.240
I had to come.

33:25.830 --> 33:26.920
He Rufei prides himself

33:27.480 --> 33:29.270
on manipulating people's minds.

33:30.310 --> 33:32.520
But he never anticipated

33:33.680 --> 33:36.070
that you would risk being charged again

33:36.790 --> 33:38.070
to reinforce Rundu.

33:42.070 --> 33:42.910
By the way,

33:43.110 --> 33:44.350
could you ask Li Kuang

33:44.510 --> 33:46.750
to draft a reinforcement request
for you and Yan He

33:47.400 --> 33:49.200
to prevent those with ulterior motives

33:50.200 --> 33:51.310
from twisting the situation?

33:54.070 --> 33:55.590
By wearing that mask this time,

33:56.590 --> 33:58.590
you've terrified the Wutuo forces.

33:59.320 --> 34:00.840
He Rufei will certainly use this

34:01.150 --> 34:02.280
to confirm your identity.

34:05.150 --> 34:06.320
Since I've come to Rundu,

34:06.710 --> 34:07.920
I'm not afraid of him knowing.

34:09.190 --> 34:10.030
When I return,

34:11.000 --> 34:13.550
I'll stand before him
with my head held high.

34:14.670 --> 34:15.800
I'll make sure he learns

34:18.030 --> 34:20.880
who the real General Feihong is.

34:24.280 --> 34:25.230
Speaking of which,

34:26.440 --> 34:27.960
since He Rufei and Xu Jingfu

34:28.190 --> 34:29.510
have been colluding for so long,

34:29.880 --> 34:30.760
there must be evidence

34:31.150 --> 34:32.440
of their collaboration.

34:33.000 --> 34:33.880
And that evidence

34:34.360 --> 34:35.230
is in the capital.

34:35.710 --> 34:37.110
So I want to return sooner

34:37.360 --> 34:39.230
to investigate potential leads.

34:40.400 --> 34:42.440
Good. I'll go with you.

34:47.110 --> 34:49.270
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

34:49.370 --> 34:53.290
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

34:53.469 --> 34:55.409
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

34:55.510 --> 35:00.440
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

35:12.530 --> 35:13.940
♪I've seen the mountains♪

35:14.140 --> 35:15.550
♪And trodden through ice♪

35:15.820 --> 35:18.640
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

35:18.940 --> 35:20.330
♪Destiny is my creed♪

35:20.390 --> 35:21.790
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

35:21.940 --> 35:23.740
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

35:24.940 --> 35:26.410
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

35:26.580 --> 35:27.860
♪Gazing through the mire♪

35:28.040 --> 35:30.430
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

35:30.630 --> 35:32.680
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

35:33.820 --> 35:35.650
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

35:37.610 --> 35:40.520
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

35:40.610 --> 35:43.280
♪There must always be a longing♪

35:43.730 --> 35:48.790
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

35:49.130 --> 35:51.130
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

35:51.450 --> 35:55.090
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

35:55.330 --> 35:57.220
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

35:57.250 --> 36:01.100
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

36:01.450 --> 36:03.390
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

36:03.580 --> 36:07.400
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

36:07.660 --> 36:13.410
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

36:14.300 --> 36:19.760
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

